  "releaseNotes": "Release notes for:\n - HandyUI.Core v1.0.2x (v1.0.2x instead of v1.0.29 to account for automatic versioning.)\n - HandyUI.WinForms v1.0.3x (v1.0.3x instead of v1.0.33 to account for automatic versioning.)\n\nNew Features & UI Controls\n - Added new controls: ImageButton, ImageLabel, ToggleButton, ImageToggleButton, and Frame\n - Introduced the HandyForm subclass in HandyUI.WinForms\n - Added animations to select controls\n - Added control parenting support\n\nImprovements & Bug Fixes\n - Fixed UI Renderer bugs\n - Improved retained mode positioning",
